[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 18661.59, "timestamp": "05:11:01", "text": "嗯，你以前是这样的。你以前是这样的。曾经是。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18664.708, "timestamp": "05:11:04", "text": "嘿，我已经长大了。我太自豪了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18668.708, "timestamp": "05:11:08", "text": "但我现在需要疗伤。我需要疗愈。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18670.948, "timestamp": "05:11:10", "text": "爸爸，我需要治疗。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18673.43, "timestamp": "05:11:13", "text": "妈妈，我需要疗伤。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18676.15, "timestamp": "05:11:16", "text": "我根本不在附近，因为我就是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18677.75, "timestamp": "05:11:17", "text": "打算留在基地。坚持，稍等。好的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18679.67, "timestamp": "05:11:19", "text": "那我得回基地了。是的，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18681.03, "timestamp": "05:11:21", "text": "这意味着我需要再砍些柴。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18682.31, "timestamp": "05:11:22", "text": "我们其实快没木头用了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18685.19, "timestamp": "05:11:25", "text": "出色地。哦，我也在劈柴。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18687.03, "timestamp": "05:11:27", "text": "然后。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18688.788, "timestamp": "05:11:28", "text": "获取一些资源。这里。你看，这里是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18689.91, "timestamp": "05:11:29", "text": "那个东西。你大部分时间都在获取"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18693.03, "timestamp": "05:11:33", "text": "被一切屠戮殆尽。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18694.628, "timestamp": "05:11:34", "text": "我需要去。你唯一的理由"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18696.47, "timestamp": "05:11:36", "text": "即使戴着冬帽也无济于事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18697.91, "timestamp": "05:11:37", "text": "而一块温泉石是因为你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18700.39, "timestamp": "05:11:40", "text": "惨遭屠杀。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18702.55, "timestamp": "05:11:42", "text": "我仍然需要人照看孩子。爸爸，你在哪儿？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18704.868, "timestamp": "05:11:44", "text": "我的电子小玩意儿？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18708.07, "timestamp": "05:11:48", "text": "哦，不。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18709.67, "timestamp": "05:11:49", "text": "我快到了。我需要吮吸一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18712.09, "timestamp": "05:11:52", "text": "电源插座。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18714.39, "timestamp": "05:11:54", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18716.708, "timestamp": "05:11:56", "text": "就是这样吗？就像安卓系统那样？"}]